  "helpSupportScreenFaq1Question": "How do I pin or unpin conversations?",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq1Answer": "Go to the recent chat list on the Home screen. Long press on any conversation card and select 'Pin Conversation' or 'Unpin Conversation' from the pop-up options sheet. Pinned chats stay anchored at the top of your list.",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq2Question": "How do I record and send audio voice messages?",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq2Answer": "Open any chat room. Tap and hold the mic icon in the message bar to record a voice note. The bar will show a recording duration and a cancel trigger. Releasing/sending will direct you to a premium preview page where you can review your WAV recording before sharing it.",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq3Question": "Where can I change the chat wallpaper backgrounds?",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq3Answer": "Navigate to your Profile tab, tap 'Appearance', and open the Chat Wallpaper customize panel. You can select custom solid backdrop colors or toggle background doodles on and off.",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq4Question": "How does message pinning work inside chat rooms?",
  "helpSupportScreenFaq4Answer": "Inside any chat thread, single-tap a message bubble to view details and tap the Pin button in the AppBar. Pinned messages appear in a floating banner at the top of the chat room. Tapping it automatically scrolls you directly to that message.",
